mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a giant garden in search of every mushroom and Insectile alike! The world of Insectile is lovingly packed with side quests, dangerous bosses, secrets to uncover, and of course, a new Insectile at every turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045270/extras/5355c676a781f0048d56d814aebb4b2f.poster.avif?t=1757338815\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045270/extras/5355c676a781f0048d56d814aebb4b2f.webm?t=1757338815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045270/extras/5355c676a781f0048d56d814aebb4b2f.mp4?t=1757338815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An innovative and thought-provoking battle system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Insectiles to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An overly confident and obnoxious rival character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wear your favorite Insectiles on your head</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bestiary to fill up with research</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morph Insectiles into new forms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of grubs</p></li></ul>","developers":["Narwhalnut LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045270/b978ced2d537842343ba257f2eecea622d3b37da/he